  "intraday_notes": [
    {
      "id": "note-a47b7dcc1851",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 09:39:00 EDT",
      "text": "中實體K線開盤，開盤BO，嘗試Sell limit",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:26:27.624644+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:26:27.624651+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-ae92023a44a0",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 09:44:00 EDT",
      "text": "很強的下影線陽線，這邊拿單根K線平均波幅，不拿到前低",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:27:15.145058+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:27:15.145064+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-5953a84711fc",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 09:49:00 EDT",
      "text": "可能判斷錯誤，開盤BO波幅不夠大，轉為開盤TR\n守停損、看有沒有BE機會",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:28:25.289394+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:28:42.895736+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-71e0e6069843",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 09:59:00 EDT",
      "text": "多方BO，看有沒有小結構10點反轉",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:30:00.181934+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:30:00.181946+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-abad58388992",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 10:19:00 EDT",
      "text": "開始無效K線，可能TTR",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:31:30.870105+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:31:30.870119+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-80cf4ef97c6e",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 10:24:00 EDT",
      "text": "空方SB，會偏向多方操作\n1. 1m WBO 測WBO MM進入TR\n2. 多方階梯上漲拿波幅\n3. 大反轉整天震盪",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:33:09.513726+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:33:38.113522+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-3abea81b6a41",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 10:34:00 EDT",
      "text": "測WBO MM後看起來要多方延續或TR整天波幅還沒拿到，最好先不要Sell limit",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:34:27.665185+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:34:43.968368+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-103ddd91e9ad",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 11:19:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊等拿到波幅後12點反轉看有沒有機會\nTTR BO開始反轉",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:35:57.162553+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:36:57.459350+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-d76b96f57b31",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 11:49:00 EDT",
      "text": "開始無效K線等空方Confirm bar或BO bar",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:37:24.704060+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:37:24.704069+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-cf3b0de3b181",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 12:14:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊幾乎拿到全天波幅、有Channel BO Failed的可能，可能半區震盪\n1. 做空方反轉上半區\n2. 等上半區出來Limit order",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:38:48.112336+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:57:45.269074+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-408100ab32b8",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 12:19:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊用大停損前高Sell limit + SOTB 還有空間",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:40:05.962513+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:40:05.962520+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-56c824e02570",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 13:19:00 EDT",
      "text": "回測前高附近沒碰到後大陰線\n多方選擇TP、空方選擇加倉，半區可能已經出來，看BO是否成功",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:43:25.459679+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:43:25.459688+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-ab9126cddabb",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 13:39:00 EDT",
      "text": "BO成功，嘗試拿DT BO 1R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:44:18.626472+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:44:18.626479+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-180dbd09475b",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 14:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "DB SB，除非下一根收實體陽線，不然前低TP機會還是偏高",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:46:23.005644+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:46:23.005653+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-11e141410cd0",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-02 14:40:00 EDT",
      "text": "這邊沒拿到DT BO 1R\n但是拿到Actual risk 2R 選擇離場，可能進入震盪\n沒有倉位的話可以Buy Limit",
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T12:48:29.960160+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-28T12:51:03.482593+00:00"
    }
  ],
